  "ai_language_tip": "Speak clear Bokmål Norwegian (nb); listeners use many dialects and some write Nynorsk (nn, west coast) but understand Bokmål; English is excellent nationwide and accepted, though fastlege offices and NAV prefer Norwegian.",
  "english_ok": "yes — Very high English nationwide; only some elderly or rural staff prefer Norwegian.",
  "politeness": "Informal 'du' is standard; open with 'Hei' or 'God dag' and say whom you call for; close with 'Takk, ha det'. Direct and brief.",
  "name_tip": "First name + surname, informal; surname alone works for a booking ('på navnet Hansen'); spell foreign names letter by letter.",
  "phone_tip": "All numbers are 8 digits with no trunk 0 (mobiles start with 4 or 9), +47; read as 3-2-3 or in pairs; Vipps is tied to the mobile number.",
  "time_tip": "TRAP: 'halv åtte' = 7:30; 'kvart på åtte' = 7:45; dinner is often at 17:00; times written 'kl. 19.30'; read back in 24h.",
  "number_tip": "Older speakers may say numbers the old way ('fem og tjue' = 25) instead of 'tjuefem'; phone numbers are read in pairs; 'H0302' is a flat code (floor 3, flat 2), not a count.",
  "avoid_calling": "Avoid lunch 11:00–12:30, dinner peak 17:00–19:30 (Norwegians eat early), calls after 19:00, and Sundays; fellesferie in July closes many small firms for weeks.",
  "closed_days": "Most shops closed on Sundays and public holidays by law (small grocery shops and petrol stations excepted); Easter week (Maundy Thursday to Easter Monday), 1 and 17 May, Ascension, Whit Monday and Christmas close businesses; July fellesferie.",
  "booking_channels": "Helsenorge.no for fastlege appointments and messages; Vipps for payments; restaurant web booking and phone; Timely-style booking pages for salons; Foodora and Wolt for delivery; Finn.no for property, jobs and second-hand.",
  "voice_menu": "Helsenorge, NAV, Skatteetaten, banks and operators (Telenor, Telia) use IVR; banks verify with BankID.",
  "callback_habits": "Fastlege offices use callback and Helsenorge messages; booking systems send SMS reminders; small businesses reply by SMS.",
